{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a nearly-naked man wielding giant fans and flap your way through brutal 3D stages! Left and right mouse clicks flap each arm independently, sending you soaring\u2014or crashing\u2014through the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your stamina: each flap drains it, and once it's gone, you'll be helpless for a few seconds as you fall all the way back down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a ridiculous, challenging, and uniquely controlled flight game that will make you laugh, scream, and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Streaming and monetized gameplay videos are fully welcome!</strong> Please feel free to share your experience with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music: BGMer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679940?t=1747323459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679940?t=1747323459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679940/a46a48a4dbeffb67fa9449c4025bb7a42e3e53f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747323459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679940/a46a48a4dbeffb67fa9449c4025bb7a42e3e53f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747323459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains humorous depictions of characters (both male and female) in their underwear. There is no sexual content or suggestive behavior, and all such appearances are purely for comedic effect."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a nearly-naked man wielding giant fans and flap your way through brutal 3D stages! Left and r